menu "PocketJS guest"

    config POCKETJS_GUEST_HEAP_LIMIT
        int "Default JavaScript heap limit (bytes)"
        range 1 2147483647
        default 4194304
        help
            Default QuickJS heap limit for each guest, in bytes.
            pocketjs_guest_config_defaults() uses this value. The caller can
            override it through config.heap_limit before creating the guest.

            Leave memory for native UI objects, display buffers, other firmware
            components, and allocation overhead. This limits QuickJS memory
            accounting, not total PSRAM usage, and does not change the GC
            trigger threshold.

endmenu
